    {   heading: "Utility Costs: Who Pays for What?", level: 2, paragraphs: [
      "Wireless carriers will need utilities to power their equipment, but the lease agreement should clearly specify who is responsible for paying for these costs. In some cases, you might be required to cover utility expenses, while other leases may include separate meters or require the carrier to reimburse you for their usage. Understanding how these expenses will be handled can help avoid surprises down the line.",
